For functionality like this you need an actionButton <http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/actionButton.html> and an observeEvent <http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/observeEvent.html>. For example

###UI
shinyUI(pageWithSidebar(
  sidebarPanel(

    actionButton("goButton", "Go!")
  ),
  mainPanel(

       d3heatmapOutput("heatmap", width = "auto")

))

##server
shinyServer(function(input, output) {

observeEvent(input$goButton, {

     output$heatmap<- renderD3heatmap({
        isolate({
              /*do stuff here*/
          })
      })
})

This should fix your problem. If it doesn't then you may have to isolate the logic within the renderD3heatmap also.

Please see this <http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/isolation.html>.

I hope this helped a bit. Good luck!

-Amber James

